      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hablemos",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800610062006C0065006D006F00730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué le pasa?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0051007500E90020006C006500200070006100730061003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Normalmente, el pelaje de un Wigglytuff es tan\nfino, suave y agradable al tacto que, si lo tocas,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nno puedes dejar de acariciarlo.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 137
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero el del mío... ¡Es espantoso y oloroso!\n¡Lo voy a llamar Wigglytufo!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y para colmo, ¡no se quiere bañaaar!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00590020007000610072006100200063006F006C006D006F002C002000A1006E006F002000730065002000710075006900650072006500200062006100F10061006100610072002100100002011401D70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero se me ocurrió algo.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPodríamos simular un combate y que usen contra\nél Rayo Burbuja para dejarlo bien limpiecito.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 125
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Podrías poner en tu equipo a un Pokémon que\nconozca el movimiento Rayo Burbuja?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAvísame cuando lo hayas hecho, porfa.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 126
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pon en tu equipo a un Pokémon que conozca el\nmovimiento Rayo Burbuja.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Así mi Wigglytuff queda rechinando de limpio!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 124
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Qué bien, ¡tienes en tu equipo un Pokémon\nque conoce el movimiento Rayo Burbuja!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nVamos, hagamos como que combatimos.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 124
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡A limpiar se ha dicho!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100410020006C0069006D007000690061007200200073006500200068006100200064006900630068006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Espera un momento",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007000650072006100200075006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bueno, pero no te tardes, que mi Wigglytuff está\nhecho una mugre y eso no puede ser.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por favor, deja a mi Wigglytuff resplandeciente\ncon un Rayo Burbuja o dos. O diez.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por favor, usa Rayo Burbuja contra mi Wigglytuff\npara dejarlo resplandeciente. ¡Te lo ruego!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wigglytuff, ¡qué limpio quedaste! Y ya no\napestas como antes, ¡qué bien!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Tuuuff!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100540075007500750066006600210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A partir de ahora te bañaré seguido,\n¿entendido?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410020007000610072007400690072002000640065002000610068006F0072006100200074006500200062006100F10061007200E90020007300650067007500690064006F002C000A00BF0065006E00740065006E006400690064006F003F00100002011401D70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Wiggly!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10057006900670067006C0079002100100002011401D70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wigglytuff le da un tremendo cachetadón.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006900670067006C007900740075006600660020006C006500200064006100200075006E0020007400720065006D0065006E0064006F00200063006100630068006500740061006400F3006E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡¿Pero por qué hiciste eso?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100BF005000650072006F00200070006F007200200071007500E900200068006900630069007300740065002000650073006F003F002100100002011401D70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿A lo mejor no se lavaba a propósito para que yo\nno lo acariciara tanto? ¿Le molestará?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oyeee, Wigglytuff, ¡espera, espera!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0079006500650065002C00200057006900670067006C00790074007500660066002C002000A1006500730070006500720061002C0020006500730070006500720061002100100002011401D70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Volvemos a las andadas: un tufo terrible\ny al agua ni se la menciones.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
